// every line of `map` come from OpenStreetMap: the route is a foot-routing result
// (routing.openstreetmap.de) and the scenery is OSM water, coastline, parks, shrine
// grounds and main roads, all projected into the map's 0 0 100 76 viewBox. Stop
// x/y are percentages of that canvas, snapped onto the route; m is metres above sea.
